<title>USA: Culbro, General Cigar merger set.</title>
<headline>Culbro, General Cigar merger set.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Culbro Corp and General Cigar Holdings Inc on Tuesday said the merger of the two companies would take place at the close of trading on August 29.</p>
<p>On September 2, all trading in Culbro shares will cease, the companies said.</p>
<p>Under the deal, each Culbro share will be exchangeable for 4.44557 shares of General Cigar.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
